{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00147",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 6.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Hi doctor, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.22,
      "end_seconds": 10.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.79,
      "end_seconds": 14.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.65,
      "end_seconds": 22.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 25.48,
      "end_seconds": 28.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "We came because of a fit last month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.89,
      "end_seconds": 32.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.52,
      "end_seconds": 35.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "About... well, about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.35,
      "end_seconds": 41.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is there anything that triggers it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.34,
      "end_seconds": 45.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I notice it more with missed sleep."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.79,
      "end_seconds": 51.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 52.09,
      "end_seconds": 56.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.53,
      "end_seconds": 63.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "I was getting to that! And I've been feeling drowsy as well, for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.63,
      "end_seconds": 66.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.08,
      "end_seconds": 73.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.03,
      "end_seconds": 79.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.54,
      "end_seconds": 81.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.23,
      "end_seconds": 98.1,
      "duration_seconds": 15.87,
      "text": "Okay. I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.14,
      "end_seconds": 101.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.69,
      "end_seconds": 103.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "And headache, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.14,
      "end_seconds": 106.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "No. No headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 107.76,
      "end_seconds": 112.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice headache. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.74,
      "end_seconds": 119.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.41,
      "end_seconds": 125.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Have you had any weakness on one side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.35,
      "end_seconds": 130.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "No. No weakness on one side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.63,
      "end_seconds": 135.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Any head injury, loss of bladder control or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.97,
      "end_seconds": 148.96,
      "duration_seconds": 12.99,
      "text": "No, uh, no head injury, no loss of bladder control, no fever. I did have a bit of confusion afterwards at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.67,
      "end_seconds": 152.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.77,
      "end_seconds": 155.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.25,
      "end_seconds": 159.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.64,
      "end_seconds": 160.38,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.84,
      "end_seconds": 179.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.65,
      "end_seconds": 182.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Just my gallbladder removed, in 2016."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.46,
      "end_seconds": 187.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.08,
      "end_seconds": 192.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.43,
      "end_seconds": 194.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.81,
      "end_seconds": 198.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.6,
      "end_seconds": 203.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.18,
      "end_seconds": 205.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.37,
      "end_seconds": 220.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.25,
      "end_seconds": 225.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Sulfa drugs. I come out in... well, itching all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.95,
      "end_seconds": 230.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.26,
      "end_seconds": 234.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Sodium valproate, 500 milligrams, maybe, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.12,
      "end_seconds": 238.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.68,
      "end_seconds": 245.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. It's iron tablets, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.15,
      "end_seconds": 252.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.47,
      "end_seconds": 260.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "I have epilepsy. Low haemoglobin, for five years. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.24,
      "end_seconds": 271.36,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known epilepsy. We'll keep that in mind today. Okay, low haemoglobin, that's already on your record. Good to know. Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.4,
      "end_seconds": 287.15,
      "duration_seconds": 14.75,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.24,
      "end_seconds": 290.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.79,
      "end_seconds": 305.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.42,
      "end_seconds": 325.42,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent, pulse 74. And temperature is 36.8 degrees, BP is 109 over 81. Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.91,
      "end_seconds": 337.85,
      "duration_seconds": 11.94,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.44,
      "end_seconds": 342.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.69,
      "end_seconds": 344.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.27,
      "end_seconds": 348.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.83,
      "end_seconds": 362.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Reflexes and power are symmetrical on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.06,
      "end_seconds": 363.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.14,
      "end_seconds": 367.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.82,
      "end_seconds": 387.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "You're alert and orientated, speech is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.35,
      "end_seconds": 418.8,
      "duration_seconds": 28.45,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with breakthrough seizure on known epilepsy at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be a provoked seizure from missed medication, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.21,
      "end_seconds": 429.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a fit last month for about four days, and no loss of bladder control or head injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 430.33,
      "end_seconds": 432.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 433.23,
      "end_seconds": 436.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 437.19,
      "end_seconds": 437.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 451.85,
      "end_seconds": 457.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let's get an MRI of the brain, for seizure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 457.66,
      "end_seconds": 460.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I can book that for Wednesday at 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 461.08,
      "end_seconds": 462.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Okay, I'll be there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 464.32,
      "end_seconds": 476.73,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "I'm going to order an EEG, for seizure. I'm going to order a blood level of the tablet, for adherence check. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 477.58,
      "end_seconds": 478.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 479.18,
      "end_seconds": 505.35,
      "duration_seconds": 26.17,
      "text": "Never skip the tablets, and set a phone alarm if it helps. No driving until we've reviewed you again, I'm sorry, but that's the rule. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. I'd like you to see the epilepsy clinic as well, and I'll write the referral. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 506.53,
      "end_seconds": 507.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 508.58,
      "end_seconds": 524.77,
      "duration_seconds": 16.19,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you have another seizure lasting more than five minutes. Please come and see me after the results are back. Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 525.77,
      "end_seconds": 530.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0074",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 530.78,
      "end_seconds": 534.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0075",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 536.19,
      "end_seconds": 538.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0076",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 539.07,
      "end_seconds": 539.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}